      "message": "test(probe): stop pinning the project version in the probe's kind-order test\n\nevery_older_kind_keeps_its_stored_id_and_digest_tag asserted\nPROJECT_VERSION == 51, so #329's v52 rung left it red on main. The kind\nid / digest-tag loop is what proves the Probe kind needed no format rung;\nthe hard-coded version proved nothing about the probe and goes stale on\nevery unrelated rung. The loop stays as the pin.\n\nFixes #344\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
